      "act": "Read The Game And Its Contract",
      "narration": "The supplied assignment snapshot calls this Assignment Seven. The working course copy has since renumbered particle work. We follow the supplied brief here: two different effects, explicit predictions, visible revisions, and separate state, appearance, and cost evidence.",
