    {
      "act": "Test Look And Tune",
      "narration": "Give the motes a separate revision. A slightly larger cyan sphere, an age fade, and a grow-shrink curve distinguish route availability from the warm burst. Two seconds of pre-roll establishes the cloud when emission starts; that choice belongs to this continuous effect.",
      "actions": [
